// A roommate agreement among Asha Verma, Luis Ortega and Mei Tanaka (roommates.md).
Document "roommates.md"

// M.1 The household
Fact person Identified by Asha, Luis, Mei
Placeholder candidate For person
Placeholder leaver For person
Fact landlord Identified by Grove
Fact roommate Identified by person
Fact usd Identified by Money(USD, 2)
Param rent : Money(USD, 2) = 200000

// M.2 Rent: shares by floor area; Asha pays the landlord, the others pay Asha
Function room Identified by person * int
Function share Identified by person * usd
  Derived from share(room.person, MulDivRound(rent, room.int, Sum(Foreach room': room'.int), Floor))
Var rent-payer Identified by person
Event month-begins
  Creates (Foreach person: rent-due(person, landlord) When roommate(person))
        , (Foreach person, person': share-due(person, person')
             When roommate(person) && rent-payer(person') && person != person')
Duty share-due Holder person Claimant person'
  Due within 1
  Terminated by pay-share
Act pay-share Actor person Recipient person' Related to usd
  Valid when share(person, usd)

// M.3 Joint liability: every roommate owes the landlord the whole rent
Duty rent-due Holder person Claimant landlord
  Due within 1
Act pay-rent Actor person Recipient landlord Related to usd
  Holds when rent-due()
  Valid when usd == rent
  Terminates (Foreach person': rent-due(person', landlord))

// M.4 Utilities
Fact bill
Duty utility-due Holder person Claimant person' Related to bill, usd
  Due within 14
  Terminated by pay-utility
Act show-bill Actor person Related to bill, usd
  Holds when roommate(person)
  Creates (Foreach person': utility-due(person', person, bill, MulDivRound(usd, 1, 3, Floor))
             When roommate(person') && person' != person)
Act pay-utility Actor person Recipient person' Related to bill, usd

// M.5 Leaving
Fact leaving Identified by person
Fact moved-out Identified by person
Act give-notice Actor person
  Holds when roommate(person)
  Creates leaving(person)
Act move-out Actor person
  Holds when Held(leaving(person)) For 30
  Creates moved-out(person)
Fact approved Identified by person * candidate
Act approve Actor person Related to candidate
  Holds when roommate(person)
  Creates approved()
Power take-place Actor candidate Related to leaver
  Holds when True
  Valid when leaving(leaver) && Not(roommate(candidate))
    && (Forall person: approved(person, candidate) When roommate(person) && person != leaver)
  Creates roommate(candidate)
        , (Foreach room: room(candidate, room.int) When room.person == leaver)
        , rent-payer(candidate) When rent-payer(leaver)
  Terminates roommate(leaver), leaving(leaver)
           , (Foreach room: room When room.person == leaver)

// M.6 Quiet hours
Bool quiet-hours
Event night-falls Creates quiet-hours()
Event morning-comes Terminates quiet-hours()
Act make-noise Actor person
  Holds when Not(quiet-hours())

// M.7 Guests
Fact guest
Fact staying Identified by guest * person
Fact consented Identified by person * guest
Act host Actor person Related to guest
  Holds when roommate(person)
  Creates guest, staying()
Act see-off Actor person Related to guest
  Holds when staying()
  Terminates staying()
Act consent-to-stay Actor person Related to guest
  Holds when roommate(person)
  Creates consented()
Duty guest-leaves Holder person Claimant person' Related to guest
  Holds when staying(guest, person) && roommate(person') && person' != person
    && Not(consented(person', guest))
  Due within 4

Clause M.1 Approved "8ad565cf6ff61aec3bd08f5999ac975bc998f119e4054006ca01e6e40a9ced70"
  Definition "Asha Verma, Luis Ortega and Mei Tanaka, the roommates, rent the flat at 9 Canal Street from Grove Lettings, the landlord."
Clause M.2 Approved "553f3ed0b713486be5a87448e22aa54a6ddc2ab381ee059403398c7e3cfaf29c"
  Norm "The rent is two thousand dollars a month." => pay-rent
  Norm " The roommates share it in proportion to the floor area of their rooms: Asha's room is fourteen square metres, Luis's twelve and Mei's ten. A share is rounded down to the cent." => pay-share
  Norm " Asha pays the landlord the whole rent on the first of each month, and each of the others pays Asha their share by the same day." => rent-due, pay-rent, share-due, pay-share
Clause M.3 Approved "213559ac72e256072cfa56a8ce27def044738438c3808b0984c486d2510bd472"
  Norm "Each roommate is liable to the landlord for the whole rent, whoever has paid a share to whom." => rent-due, pay-rent
Clause M.4 Approved "ff03730f0d0612a022723b7319764328696c5b057b26676b31e7c2a5c8dc8af8"
  Norm "A roommate who pays a utility bill is owed one third of it by each of the others, rounded down to the cent, within fourteen days after showing them the bill." => show-bill, utility-due, pay-utility
Clause M.5 Approved "dc4604cfdc3ef09f79a375a4613513eda32cbc1178eea34c587b8ff3c81c132c"
  Norm "A roommate who wants to leave gives the others thirty days' notice, and may not move out before the thirty days have passed." => give-notice, move-out
  Norm " A replacement takes the leaving roommate's room, share and place in this agreement only when every other roommate has approved the replacement." => approve, take-place
  Norm " Until then the leaving roommate remains a roommate, liable for rent and utilities, whether or not they have moved out." => take-place
Clause M.6 Approved "157638a08febf46a52287d9d724712f4853eb79b53ef4c2f95cd9007823e5a45"
  Definition "Quiet hours run from ten at night to seven in the morning."
  Norm " During quiet hours no roommate makes noise that can be heard in another roommate's room." => make-noise
Clause M.7 Approved "ca0ced883f0c9d13336fd649c250e14b14a786a7469298c21d04ff6c45422741"
  Norm "A roommate's guest may stay at most three nights in a row." => host, see-off, guest-leaves
  Norm " A longer stay needs the consent of every other roommate." => consent-to-stay, guest-leaves
.
+roommate(Asha). +roommate(Luis). +roommate(Mei).
+room(Asha, 14). +room(Luis, 12). +room(Mei, 10).
+rent-payer(Asha).
